@host = http://localhost:8082

### Health check
GET {{host}}/api/knowledge/health

### Chroma: ingest a document
POST {{host}}/api/knowledge/chroma/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Apple iPhone 15 with a titanium frame and 256GB storage"
}

### Chroma: semantic search
GET {{host}}/api/knowledge/chroma/search?query=headphones

### Tool chaining demo
GET {{host}}/api/knowledge/tools/chain?product=iphone

### Swagger UI
GET {{host}}/swagger-ui.html

### OpenAPI schema
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs